1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,129
It was meant to rival Chicago.

2
00:00:02,359 --> 00:00:03,314
Now it's gone.

3
00:00:03,544 --> 00:00:06,020
City West, Indiana, 1836.

4
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:08,714
Promoters laid it out at the mouth of Fort

5
00:00:08,724 --> 00:00:11,190
Creek, in the dunes west of Michigan City.

6
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,194
It had a sawmill, a store and a big hotel.

7
00:00:14,424 --> 00:00:16,248
Even Daniel Webster stopped there.

8
00:00:16,799 --> 00:00:19,250
Then came the Panic of 1837.

9
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,723
The harbor money it was counting on never

10
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:21,988
came.

11
00:00:22,538 --> 00:00:24,670
Within a few years, the town was empty.

12
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:27,075
Years later, one of its buildings was

13
00:00:27,085 --> 00:00:29,236
hauled off to Chesterton and became a

14
00:00:29,246 --> 00:00:29,674
hotel.

15
00:00:30,224 --> 00:00:32,319
A fire swept through and burned what was

16
00:00:32,329 --> 00:00:33,521
left of City West.

17
00:00:34,171 --> 00:00:36,537
Today the spot is part of Indiana Dunes

18
00:00:36,547 --> 00:00:37,985
State Park, near the beach.

19
00:00:38,215 --> 00:00:39,764
Nothing of the town is left.

20
00:00:40,414 --> 00:00:42,457
Comment your town, and it could be next.

